### 4.5 Test Tools
- Playwright (UI/API automation)
- PyTest (API and negative path validation)
- JMeter (SLA and load simulation)
- OWASP ZAP (security/authorization testing)
- tcconfig (network condition simulation)

#### 4.9 Tools Table
| Tool         | Purpose                                 | Usage Area           |
|--------------|-----------------------------------------|----------------------|
| Playwright   | UI/API automation                       | Automation, Negative |
| PyTest       | API and negative path validation        | Functional, Negative |
| JMeter       | SLA and load simulation                 | Regression, Load     |
| OWASP ZAP    | Security/authorization testing          | Security             |
| tcconfig     | Network condition simulation            | Resilience           |

### 4.6 Test Environments
- Integration or staging environment with Jira API connectivity
- Test Jira accounts (valid, invalid, insufficient permissions)
- Mock/stub service for 401 Unauthorized and missing-description scenarios
- Application/API gateway logs
- Test data set with accessible and restricted issue IDs

#### Data Availability
| Test Type | Data Source | Environment | Data Type | Data Volume | Comments |
|-----------|-------------|-------------|-----------|-------------|----------|
| API Auth  | Jira        | Staging     | Token     | Low         | Valid/Invalid tokens |
| Error Path| Mock API    | QA          | Issue IDs | Low         | Simulate 401/missing |

